    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/c2eb8f41cd0450f6c584149a05bd5dcb.avif?t=1754751760\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord</strong> server to stay updated on the game development and more!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35b83269168cdd65419d544773af6d43.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/33916a0750969970a8b16ac713a0e9ba.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/33916a0750969970a8b16ac713a0e9ba.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/33916a0750969970a8b16ac713a0e9ba.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shadow of the Union</strong>, crafting is the key to successfully completing government contracts. Using collected materials and secret vials, you can create items and upgrades for your base and equipment. Every item you craft helps increase the efficiency of mission completion and ensures the smooth operation of your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/0998b0b42751bb7cb7b6532f4a658e54.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/aea12be8a1432e8220de16e2e9fc94ed.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/aea12be8a1432e8220de16e2e9fc94ed.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/aea12be8a1432e8220de16e2e9fc94ed.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base is a key part of survival and contract completion. It\u2019s your refuge and starting point for missions. Build and upgrade your base in preparation for monster waves by placing defensive structures and automating protection with electrical systems and turrets. Also, prepare your vehicle for missions by upgrading it with necessary resources. Your base must withstand any threats and ensure security for the successful completion of contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/b70853488e3f391ce46ab5a79a1481c0.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35f9b9d49a1173da6fb3ace401bdd657.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35f9b9d49a1173da6fb3ace401bdd657.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35f9b9d49a1173da6fb3ace401bdd657.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sortie is part of a secret mission. Explore forgotten locations from the USSR era \u2014 from destroyed military sites to the depths of classified laboratories and bunkers. Radiation, traps, and aggressive mutants are just obstacles on your path to the goal. Use transport for equipment delivery and emergency evacuation, collect evidence, resources, and data. Attention and caution are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/0c409fee35f22658bc63a4d9e3b11162.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/a5c6ad1f5d5c79667222aeab6efd0030.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/a5c6ad1f5d5c79667222aeab6efd0030.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/a5c6ad1f5d5c79667222aeab6efd0030.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In cooperative mode, up to 4 players face traps, enemies, and secrets of the past. Each player has an important role \u2014 reconnaissance, support, or combat. Victory requires clear division of duties, tactics, and teamwork. Use the built-in voice chat to coordinate actions in real time \u2014 as communication at critical moments can save your team. Only coordinated effort and trust will help you survive in this dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/8d6b4ad64e15239b798223a39deb7da2.avif?t=1754751760\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35b83269168cdd65419d544773af6d43.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/33916a0750969970a8b16ac713a0e9ba.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/33916a0750969970a8b16ac713a0e9ba.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/33916a0750969970a8b16ac713a0e9ba.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Shadow of the Union</strong>, crafting is the key to successfully completing government contracts. Using collected materials and secret vials, you can create items and upgrades for your base and equipment. Every item you craft helps increase the efficiency of mission completion and ensures the smooth operation of your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/0998b0b42751bb7cb7b6532f4a658e54.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/aea12be8a1432e8220de16e2e9fc94ed.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/aea12be8a1432e8220de16e2e9fc94ed.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/aea12be8a1432e8220de16e2e9fc94ed.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base is a key part of survival and contract completion. It\u2019s your refuge and starting point for missions. Build and upgrade your base in preparation for monster waves by placing defensive structures and automating protection with electrical systems and turrets. Also, prepare your vehicle for missions by upgrading it with necessary resources. Your base must withstand any threats and ensure security for the successful completion of contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/b70853488e3f391ce46ab5a79a1481c0.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35f9b9d49a1173da6fb3ace401bdd657.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35f9b9d49a1173da6fb3ace401bdd657.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/35f9b9d49a1173da6fb3ace401bdd657.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sortie is part of a secret mission. Explore forgotten locations from the USSR era \u2014 from destroyed military sites to the depths of classified laboratories and bunkers. Radiation, traps, and aggressive mutants are just obstacles on your path to the goal. Use transport for equipment delivery and emergency evacuation, collect evidence, resources, and data. Attention and caution are key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/0c409fee35f22658bc63a4d9e3b11162.webp?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/a5c6ad1f5d5c79667222aeab6efd0030.poster.avif?t=1754751760\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/a5c6ad1f5d5c79667222aeab6efd0030.webm?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/a5c6ad1f5d5c79667222aeab6efd0030.mp4?t=1754751760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In cooperative mode, up to 4 players face traps, enemies, and secrets of the past. Each player has an important role \u2014 reconnaissance, support, or combat. Victory requires clear division of duties, tactics, and teamwork. Use the built-in voice chat to coordinate actions in real time \u2014 as communication at critical moments can save your team. Only coordinated effort and trust will help you survive in this dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574810/extras/8d6b4ad64e15239b798223a39deb7da2.avif?t=1754751760\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p>",
